														<td valign="top">
															
															First...Spell Casting Subtelty does affect DoTs. After getting SCS3 AA, I get agro far less than I used to. I haven't changed my spell sets or my style of play, so the AA is resposible for the change.<br /><br />Second.../rs is reserved....for things important to the raid. Now....if you think a healer in the CCH being at 15m isn't important to the raid, well....&lt;shrug&gt;.<br /><br />Third....I've only attended maybe 20 or so OR Official Raids and numerous offnight raids and I can tell you that the system presently in place for clerics to get twitched, does not work. This will become more of an issue as OR progresses into the EP. <br /><br />Handle it however you wish....it was merely an experience I shared to give the leadership here another option. I consider myself a very seasoned raider, as I've raided up through Time, KT, and OOW content.<br />
